{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《2026香港小姐競選》12位佳麗昨日（12日）到廣州從化進行外景拍攝的工作，12位佳麗今日正式進行泳裝拍攝環節，個個都準備充足，比起之前泳裝的環節，個人更有自信，體態亦有進步。</p><figure><img alt=\"1號袁絲珩。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153316405802700800183972.jpeg/zJT6NeLmHmgy6r5tPPRCuuhextZK1LTrbF7XtVpe17U\"/><figcaption>1號袁絲珩。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2號李澤欣。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153316555182837760726059.jpeg/GMBW_rO7ZjjncGfWXPwL_efRkoINNxNFLGtrnhpra54\"/><figcaption>2號李澤欣。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"3號李澄晴。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153316909865766912531246.jpeg/wBZLVHHAFTvs9XDMslzzDGWim55yWfnJqZ_6CJ-f-gg\"/><figcaption>3號李澄晴。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"4號譚雅文。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153317094549360640841097.jpeg/KhrvsYszMd9JmHNuqsnlABzEGJOcZD3cbnRVMFh0VTA\"/><figcaption>4號譚雅文。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5號魏欣。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153317263500120064856324.jpeg/a0XRxs38OH1PVvsOw8McCLuKqUv7vfg1ny0piaktKYk\"/><figcaption>5號魏欣。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"6號盧蔚晴。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153313965997035520091357.jpeg/Cgwtvj-a38b8eRNKMUTDTYTuX624POho8zjVuMU41bg\"/><figcaption>6號盧蔚晴。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7號楊媛媛。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153314541707202560924731.jpeg/nkMtyNNXdCFPBE7k29NNHqRLndwdh2UXtIbtGoKG7Ro\"/><figcaption>7號楊媛媛。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"8號鄧匡閔。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153314407502057472396275.jpeg/z8UjJf4tnrBtwLw0m4nLKF4JvEgbOCKpphkUqZAZFKk\"/><figcaption>8號鄧匡閔。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9號周芳姿 。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153314190090309632395207.jpeg/mrt8FZxH0RpofwQzt4VqZV1xLE4R7H_omNrJca7ayXE\"/><figcaption>9號周芳姿 。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"10號陳梓穎。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153313767551930368123785.jpeg/0A1U-HjwkWtvcRjCjXrCcK-6QyUu01hyyF_UNf5f1DU\"/><figcaption>10號陳梓穎。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"11號顏懿菲。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153314855369838592127038.jpeg/B-pPga8-91sCu3AkvTyfld_uNkg57-PQV5HV12GR1dc\"/><figcaption>11號顏懿菲。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"12號湯家琳。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153313873399386112296075.jpeg/Q2AYc5-89kdf033Ni_oTfZSR4bdMv35a56iDyueog8o\"/><figcaption>12號湯家琳。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1至6號合照。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153315173482893312540791.jpeg/UcF8B1TZvmpttZYyqpHvQnfTSaNHyQhAaocSz1yHEs8\"/><figcaption>1至6號合照。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7至12號合照。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153315170051821568632017.jpeg/qoramjxauC9lqmVlEkfBJTFr6E5Bx5FtToCqtXiAqrU\"/><figcaption>7至12號合照。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大合照。（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153315167254089728731205.jpeg/vGHdtu57eOQX5G9R7IbtkKEbJP4su-2_n56M8qmejPI\"/><figcaption>大合照。（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-13T04:59:53.426209+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":288,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}